/-! Lane owner:a-small-1, R16 (T44 `lem:parameters` C:61-72, U10 `eq:schedule` C:18-29), part 1:
ONE fixed arithmetic program `ratProg` (no parameters at all) on the bank `AK = Fin 9 ⊕ Fin 22`.

Input cells (unary): 0 n, 1 a, 2 a·m, 3 2bΔ, 4 6144b, 5 s, 6 w, 7 L, 8 Q.  Nineteen parts joined by
eighteen charged `BitMachineRawSequence` handoffs: the admitted `multiplyProgram` (eleven times), the
admitted `ETHParameterScaleMachineMax.program` (twice), the admitted `unaryPowerProgram` (twice), and
one-step pushes of the five machine constants 65536, 16, 1, 10, 320.  Output cells (unary):
new 0 = a·(a·m) (numerator of eta and delta_U), new 8 = eta denominator, new 11 = delta_U denominator,
new 12 = 1 (numerator of rho, x, theta), new 13 = 2^L, new 16 = 2^(10L), new 18 = 320·Q.
Scratch: new 19, 20, 21 (blank again after every part).  Generated by gen_rat.py. -/

set_option maxHeartbeats 64000000
set_option maxRecDepth 16384
set_option linter.unusedSimpArgs false

namespace SmallRatProg

